        "worked_solution": "To find $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}$ we differentiate the given first-order partial derivative $\\frac{∂f}{∂y}$ with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\frac{∂f}{∂y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({y}^{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1+3xy)) \\\\  & =3{y}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1+3xy)+3x{y}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1+3xy)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
